{"id":"bd75c125f807c9a0","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-term-interpretation.md","title":"Term Interpretation","display":"df-term-interpretation — Term Interpretation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-term-interpretation","aliases":["88-df-term-interpretation"],"display":"df-term-interpretation — Term Interpretation","depends_on":["[[88-df-structure]]","[[88-df-assignment]]","[[./88-df-term]]","[[88-df-variable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-term-interpretation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-term-interpretation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-term-interpretation — Term Interpretation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3a560d130315ebdc\" href=\"?note=3a560d130315ebdc\" title=\"88-df-structure\">88-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ecd5088fa3a87ce8\" href=\"?note=ecd5088fa3a87ce8\" title=\"88-df-assignment\">88-df-assignment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b768b53c62ab02de\" href=\"?note=b768b53c62ab02de\" title=\"./88-df-term\">88-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8fb998e5ff14bea3\" href=\"?note=8fb998e5ff14bea3\" title=\"88-df-variable\">88-df-variable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak A)\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>-structure, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3a560d130315ebdc\" href=\"?note=3a560d130315ebdc\" title=\"88-df-structure\">88-df-structure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Asn}_S(\\mathfrak A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Asn}_S(\\mathfrak A)\\)</span> (assignment set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ecd5088fa3a87ce8\" href=\"?note=ecd5088fa3a87ce8\" title=\"88-df-assignment\">88-df-assignment</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Term}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Term}_S\\)</span> (term set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b768b53c62ab02de\" href=\"?note=b768b53c62ab02de\" title=\"./88-df-term\">88-df-term</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_S,\\mathrm{Const}_S,\\mathrm{Func}_S^n\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_S,\\mathrm{Const}_S,\\mathrm{Func}_S^n\\)</span> (syntactic classes)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket t\\rrbracket_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}\">\\(\\llbracket t\\rrbracket_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}\\)</span> (value of a term)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}term\\text{-}interpretation}\\vdash\n\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Asn}_S(\\mathfrak A)\\;\n\\begin{aligned}[t]\n&amp;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\n\\bigl(\\llbracket x\\rrbracket_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}=\\beta(x)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_S\\;\n\\bigl(\\llbracket c\\rrbracket_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}=c^{\\mathfrak A}\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\geq1\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_S^n\\;\n\\forall(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S^n\\;\\Bigl(\n\\llbracket f(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\rrbracket_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{5em}=\nf^{\\mathfrak A}\\bigl(\\llbracket t_1\\rrbracket_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta},\n\\ldots,\\llbracket t_n\\rrbracket_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}term\\text{-}interpretation}\\vdash\n\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Asn}_S(\\mathfrak A)\\;\n\\begin{aligned}[t]\n&amp;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\n\\bigl(\\llbracket x\\rrbracket_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}=\\beta(x)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_S\\;\n\\bigl(\\llbracket c\\rrbracket_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}=c^{\\mathfrak A}\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\geq1\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_S^n\\;\n\\forall(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S^n\\;\\Bigl(\n\\llbracket f(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\rrbracket_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{5em}=\nf^{\\mathfrak A}\\bigl(\\llbracket t_1\\rrbracket_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta},\n\\ldots,\\llbracket t_n\\rrbracket_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket t\\rrbracket_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}\">\\(\\llbracket t\\rrbracket_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}\\)</span> : 项在结构和赋值下的值</li>\n<li>这些等式按项的有限构造深度唯一确定一个到\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathfrak A)\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathfrak A)\\)</span>的函数。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"3a560d130315ebdc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"ecd5088fa3a87ce8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-assignment]]","embed":false},{"target":"./88-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"b768b53c62ab02de","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[./88-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-variable","status":"resolved","id":"8fb998e5ff14bea3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerp